#To Modify the customAttribute(1-15) or On prem ExtensionAttribute(1-15)
#Prerequisites GRAPH API permission PeopleSettings.ReadWrite.All - consent Yes
#Prerequisites GRAPH API permission Directory.Read.All - consent Yes
#Prerequisites GRAPH API permission Directory.ReadWrite.All - consent Yes
Tenant Level Global Admin

Login to https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/graph-explorer

Querry GET CAll to see free atributes
GET https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/admin/people/profileCardProperties
This will show the customAttributes Modified.  [save the JSON file for backup purpose.]
If you want to check in Local ON-Prem AD used or Unused Attribute use PS commands in my PS branch

let us Assure we want to change CustomAttribute1 and display that as tester no in profile card

POST CAll and request payload as below (Localisation is optional)
PoST https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/admin/people/profileCardProperties
{
  "directoryPropertyName": "CustomAttribute1",
  "annotations": [
    {
      "displayName": "Tester No.",
      "localizations": [
        {
          "languageTag": "en",
          "displayName": "Tester No."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}


This may take upto 24 Hours to populate in profile card.
